    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=A competitor just filed a new U.S. trademark application.\n\nOwner: {{ $json.owner }}\nMark: \"{{ $json.wordmark }}\"\nFiled: {{ $json.filedDate }}\nClass(es): {{ $json.internationalClasses }}\nGoods/services: {{ $json.goodsAndServices }}\n\nIn 2-3 sentences of plain English: what product, feature, or sub-brand does this filing most likely signal, and why should a competitor care? Base it only on the goods/services text, say clearly that it is a guess, and do not invent details that are not in the filing. Never write a model version number (no 'Claude 3.5', 'GPT-4o', etc.); name products only."
      },
      "name": "Explain what they're building",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        1610,
        340
      ],
      "id": "n9"
    },
    {
